    "id" : "EqualsOnSignatureLine",
    "level" : "Info",
    "category" : "CodeStyle",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce equals sign on the same line as expression style function signature",
    "description" : "Ensures that the equals sign in expression style functions is placed on the same line as the function signature.",
    "explanation" : "# EqualsOnSignatureLine\n\nRequires that the equals sign, when used for an expression style function, is on the same line as the\nrest of the function signature.\n\n## Noncompliant Code\n\n```kotlin\nfun stuff(): Int\n    = 5\n\nfun <V> foo(): Int where V : Int\n    = 5\n```\n## Compliant Code\n\n```kotlin\nfun stuff() = 5\n\nfun stuff() =\n    foo.bar()\n\nfun <V> foo(): Int where V : Int = 5\n```\n\n[Source](https://detekt.dev/docs/rules/style#equalsonsignatureline)",
